%%{init: {"sequence": {"mirrorActors": false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Passenger
    participant App
    participant Feed as Delay feed
    participant AIS as AIS receiver

    AIS->>Feed: Position report (every 15 s)
    Feed->>Feed: Estimate arrival $$\hat{t} = t_0 + \frac{d}{v}$$
    P->>App: Open route page
    App->>Feed: GET /routes/skerry/delays
    alt Delayed more than 2 minutes
        Feed-->>App: Delay of 6 min
        App-->>P: Shows "6 min late"
    else On time
        Feed-->>App: On time
        App-->>P: Shows departure time
    end
    Note over Feed,AIS: Gaps up to 2 minutes are tolerated
